RUN program

Starts a program: HACK, TERMINAL or HOLOTAPE. RUN with no name asks
for one; Ctrl-C drops it. Any other name is refused.

  RUN TERMINAL   opens your terminal menu. BACK at its top closes it.
  RUN HOLOTAPE   opens the holotape reader. BACK on the list of tapes
                 closes it.
  RUN HACK       opens the password game. The game plays only at the
                 login prompt, so from a session it says why it cannot
                 start. BACK closes it.

Example:
  RUN HOLOTAPE
